    24→    <source media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" srcset="./.github/logos/mozilla.svg">
    25→    <img alt="Mozilla Builders logo" width=400>
    26→  </picture>
    27→  </a>
    28→</p>
    30→<p align="center">
