    152→## See Also
    154→- [**`sqlite-ecosystem`**](https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-ecosystem), Maybe
    155→  more 3rd party SQLite extensions I've developed
    156→- [**`sqlite-rembed`**](https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-rembed), Generate text
    157→  embeddings from remote APIs like OpenAI/Nomic/Ollama, meant for testing and
    158→  SQL scripts
    159→- [**`sqlite-lembed`**](https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-lembed), Generate text
    160→  embeddings locally from embedding models in the `.gguf` format
